osting and bulk SMS services. We focus on creating innovative, reliable and scalable solutions that help businesses grow and succeed in the digital world.\r\n\r\nWe specialize in creating modern, responsive and SEO-friendly websites that improve your Google ranking, attract more customers, and increase your business growth. Our software solutions help businesses automate their processes, improve efficiency, and manage operations more effectively.','147, KVP Complex, 2nd Floor, Chinnamuthu Main Street, Adukkuparai',NULL,'Erode','Tamil Nadu','638001','India','https://www.sakthiinfotech.com/',NULL,'9498940000','9090950050','{\"facebook\":\"https://chatgpt.com/c/6a56eaaf-0f74-83e8-9d56-4554d5ff2dc0\",\"instagram\":\"https://chatgpt.com/c/6a56eaaf-0f74-83e8-9d56-4554d5ff2dc0\"}','Mon: 09:00 AM - 06:30 PM | Tue: 09:30 AM - 06:30 PM | Wed: 09:30 AM - 06:30 PM | Thu: 09:00 AM - 06:30 PM | Fri: 09:30 AM - 06:30 PM | Sat: 09:00 AM - 06:30 PM | Sun: 10:00 AM - 06:30 PM',NULL,'APPROVED','2026-08-05 10:02:16','2026-08-23 10:22:18',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'vp_1785924136062_kanb3','sakthi-infotech','VEN-SGKXV4','info@sakthiinfotech.com'),(18,10000004,'PRODUCT','Barath C',NULL,NULL,NULL,'₹10 Lakhs - ₹50 Lakhs',2022,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'https://res.cloudinary.com/c0v0uxu6/image/upload/v1787480202/stores/Adobe_Express_-_file_1786783575087_90010409_main.webp','https://res.cloudinary.com/c0v0uxu6/image/upload/v1787480205/stores/Adobe_Express_-_file_1786783585387_dc27ec35_main.webp','[]','[]',NULL,'gfreg',NULL,NULL,'tamilnadu',NULL,'india',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"facebook\":\"\",\"instagram\":\"\"}','Mon: 12:00 AM - 11:30 PM | Tue: 09:00 AM - 06:00 PM | Wed: 09:00 AM - 06:00 PM | Thu: 09:00 AM - 06:00 PM | Fri: 09:00 AM - 06:00 PM | Sat: 10:00 AM - 06:00 PM | Sun: 12:00 AM - 11:30 PM',NULL,'APPROVED','2026-08-05 10:02:57','2026-08-23 10:18:01',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'vp_1785924177048_dib9w','barath-c','VEN-Y977LO',NULL),(19,10000012,'